      "Warning: alpha=tensor([[[[0.0175]],\n",
      "\n",
      "         [[0.0179]],\n",
      "\n",
      "         [[0.0178]]]]) might be too large for ε=tensor([[[[0.0873]],\n",
      "\n",
      "         [[0.0893]],\n",
      "\n",
      "         [[0.0889]]]]), iterations=10\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stderr",
